  "bodyHash": "A4QF0Uf7gaU=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1186829728972275743/MiniaturaCurseForge.jpg?ex=6594ac51&amp;is=65823751&amp;hm=d9e32a398989be12ac8153ffdad9804a4e002f1d52fc61601a57adb31368be7e&amp;\" alt=\"\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Sp2esSu.jpg\"></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">可馴服與騎乘的生物、每種生物專屬的新鞍具、新方塊、礦石、生態域與物品</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">需要 GeckoLib 模組&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#396\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此下載</a></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#3cc\"><strong>注意：若遊戲崩潰，必須刪除資料夾中的設定檔：.Minecraft/config: gammacreaturesconfig.json</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#f00\"><strong>若不確定是否使用此模組，請勿在已建立或重要的世界中使用，因為移除模組將導致無法繼續遊玩該世界。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">這些生物在世界各處生成，</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">你需要擊敗牠們才能馴服，</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">每種生物皆擁有伽瑪能量，使其具備特殊能力，</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">生物設有耐力系統，耗盡後可使用「耐力膠囊」恢復。</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">馴服前請查閱指南書，確認所需馴服道具類型。</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">- 鞍具：&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IpIKcHE.png\" width=\"974\" height=\"730\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 物品：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>模組資訊指南書：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z4XTjnt.jpeg\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nZlZRpO.png\" width=\"941\" height=\"885\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>水晶球：</strong>（使用次數有限）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CgrXcRI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"716\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 生物：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>塔魯</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TLpfGLH.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"675\" height=\"539\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>放射性鬣狗</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RBsNdSX.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"611\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>阿魯賓</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M82nkF1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"330\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>放射性鯊魚</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Pv3GJTq.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"746\" height=\"432\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>雷納特</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8KDMApW.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"644\" height=\"373\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>梅洛隆</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KLjh9JE.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"470\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>放射性貓頭鷹</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SJVGvQ3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>森達</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XRTuPQy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"445\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>放射性蜜蜂</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J18DSKf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"727\" height=\"421\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>斯賓托</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jLDfCxg.gif\"></p>\n<p>卡雷亞特羅斯</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RPrVww5.gif\"></p>\n<p>班杜</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XGKldp7.gif\"></p>\n<p>放射性熊</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cSLUCVs.gif\"></p>\n<p>克拉蘇</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nz9BLWF.gif\"></p>\n<p>多吉希</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6yyA9Yn.gif\"></p>\n<p>多斯莫</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DM8u6ZZ.gif\"></p>\n<p>札特拉</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YiiwXOO.gif\"></p>\n<p>鑽石巨人</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/niVYtjk.gif\"></p>\n<p>古斯諾</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x3G1F63.gif\"></p>\n<p>莫洛托</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SMfVJ0o.gif\"></p>\n<p>穆巴</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/giu3s4A.gif\"></p>\n<p>穿山甲</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKJpa5G.gif\"></p>\n<p>格魯德爾斯</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z0vU5rl.gif\"></p>\n<p>謝科</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BA5zRzz.gif\"></p>\n<p>斯金諾</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RNXMWaY.gif\" width=\"458\" height=\"417\"></p>\n<p>蜘蛛</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AGASklL.gif\"></p>\n<p>紅雷</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NMBrHhp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"297\"></p>\n<p>斯諾維</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IjqFXMG.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"288\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SfNabG3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"266\"></p>\n<p>達克尼克斯</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hc4L4iH.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"252\"></p>\n<p>德拉佐</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O9aMDMz.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"436\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p>朱維克斯</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/i8j1FEj.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"252\"></p>\n<p>圖爾蘭</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IXORlRJ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"236\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>版本：1.0.1</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;新增生物生成設定系統：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>調整時需更改機率數值，但機制為反向運作：數值越大，生物生成機率越低；數值越小，生成機率越高。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f00\">最小值 0，最大值 100 <span style=\"color:#000\">（設為 100 將完全停用該生物生成）</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xAfhZdE.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"324\"><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>實體清單：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/avuEiwc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"377\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/amBeldHvq0A?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rg-fYka9XSA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jv7Yyl7ZUG0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>可用於模組包，請務必標註來源。&nbsp;若可能，請附上此論壇文章連結。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>- 材質與模型由 <span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">ALe96</span> 製作</strong></p><p><strong>- 音效由 <span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">ALe96</span> 編輯</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ALe9620LN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/47cq8jD.png\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\"></span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><br></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgE5KOwkiUFAJCDEna9ADVw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bWaFgko.png\" width=\"29\" height=\"29\"></a></span></strong></p>",
